The charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter [[cite:obs-8254d83357294a4f519ddc5a3f8054233f6bfdf2 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]. The annex specifies that the ordinary contributions amount to one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January [[cite:obs-1ac4bdf35f8fa703cd51c6d7094584663f503566 "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]].